        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>第2课时 第1课时练习课 - 分数的加法和减法</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  },\n  svg: { fontCache: 'global' }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #efe9dd;\n    font-family: \"Songti SC\", \"SimSun\", serif;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #f6f2e8;\n    position: relative;\n    padding: 8px 14px 40px 14px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    min-height: 720px;\n  }\n  .header {\n    text-align: right;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    color: #111;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #999;\n    padding-bottom: 3px;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .header .unit {\n    color: #c0392b;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-right: 4px;\n  }\n  h1.title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    margin: 10px 0 12px 0;\n  }\n  .columns {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 14px;\n  }\n  .col {\n    flex: 1;\n    min-width: 0;\n  }\n  .col.left {\n    border-right: 1px solid #b9b2a4;\n    padding-right: 12px;\n  }\n  .qnum {\n    color: #1f4e9c;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .qhead {\n    color: #1f4e9c;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 8px 0 4px 0;\n  }\n  p {\n    margin: 5px 0;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n  }\n  .indent {\n    margin-left: 12px;\n  }\n  /* handwriting answers */\n  .hw {\n    color: #d02b2b;\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"KaiTi\", cursive;\n  }\n  .hw-blue {\n    color: #1b4fa0;\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"KaiTi\", cursive;\n  }\n  .work {\n    color: #d02b2b;\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"KaiTi\", cursive;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    margin: 6px 0 6px 18px;\n  }\n  .work-blue {\n    color: #1b4fa0;\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"KaiTi\", cursive;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    margin: 6px 0 6px 18px;\n  }\n  /* 算一算 grid */\n  .calc {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    column-gap: 10px;\n    row-gap: 2px;\n    margin-left: 6px;\n  }\n  .calc div {\n    line-height: 2.1;\n  }\n  /* 连一连 */\n  .connect {\n    position: relative;\n    height: 230px;\n    margin-top: 6px;\n  }\n  .box {\n    border: 1px solid #333;\n    display: inline-block;\n    padding: 2px 6px;\n    background: transparent;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    position: absolute;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    border: 1px dashed #b06;\n    color: #b06;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .lines-ph {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 6px;\n    top: 34px;\n    width: 210px;\n    height: 160px;\n  }\n  .pagenum {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 26px;\n    bottom: 8px;\n    background: #1b6fb8;\n    color: #fff;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    width: 26px;\n    height: 26px;\n    line-height: 26px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 12px;\n  }\n  .footer-rule {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 14px;\n    right: 14px;\n    bottom: 20px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #1b6fb8;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <span class=\"unit\">6</span>分数的加法和减法\n  </div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"title\">第 2 课时　第 1 课时练习课</h1>\n\n  <div class=\"columns\">\n\n    <!-- LEFT COLUMN -->\n    <div class=\"col left\">\n\n      <div class=\"qhead\">1.填一填。</div>\n\n      <p>(1)$\\dfrac{4}{11}+\\dfrac{5}{11}$表示（<span class=\"hw\">4</span>）个$\\dfrac{1}{11}$加上（<span class=\"hw\">5</span>）个</p>\n      <p>$\\dfrac{1}{11}$，是（<span class=\"hw\">9</span>）个$\\dfrac{1}{11}$，就是（<span class=\"hw\">$\\dfrac{9}{11}$</span>）。</p>\n\n      <p>(2)计算$\\dfrac{2}{3}-\\dfrac{1}{2}$时，因为两个分数的（<span class=\"hw\">分母</span>）</p>\n      <p>不同，不能直接相减，所以应先（<span class=\"hw\">通分</span>），化</p>\n      <p>成（<span class=\"hw\">同分母</span>）分数再相减。</p>\n\n      <p>(3)比$\\dfrac{4}{5}$m长$\\dfrac{3}{8}$m的是（<span class=\"hw\">$\\dfrac{47}{40}$</span>）m。</p>\n\n      <p>(4)分数单位是$\\dfrac{1}{12}$的最简真分数有</p>\n      <p>（<span class=\"hw\">$\\dfrac{1}{12},\\dfrac{5}{12},\\dfrac{7}{12},\\dfrac{11}{12}$</span>），它们的和是（<span class=\"hw\">2</span>）。</p>\n\n      <div class=\"qhead\">2.算一算。</div>\n\n      <div class=\"calc\">\n        <div>$\\dfrac{5}{12}+\\dfrac{7}{12}$<span class=\"hw\">$=\\dfrac{15}{24}+\\dfrac{14}{24}=\\dfrac{14}{24}$</span></div>\n        <div>$\\dfrac{1}{3}+\\dfrac{4}{15}$<span class=\"hw\">$=\\dfrac{5}{15}+\\dfrac{4}{15}=\\dfrac{9}{15}$</span></div>\n        <div>$\\dfrac{2}{3}-\\dfrac{1}{4}$<span class=\"hw\">$=\\dfrac{8}{12}+\\dfrac{3}{12}=\\dfrac{5}{12}$</span></div>\n        <div>$\\dfrac{2}{3}-\\dfrac{3}{5}$<span class=\"hw\">$=\\dfrac{10}{15}-\\dfrac{9}{15}=\\dfrac{1}{15}$</span></div>\n        <div>$\\dfrac{3}{5}+\\dfrac{2}{9}$<span class=\"hw\">$=\\dfrac{6}{9}+\\dfrac{5}{9}=\\dfrac{11}{9}$</span></div>\n        <div>$\\dfrac{7}{8}+\\dfrac{7}{12}$<span class=\"hw\">$=\\dfrac{21}{24}+\\dfrac{14}{24}=\\dfrac{35}{24}$</span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"qhead\">3.连一连。</div>\n\n      <div class=\"connect\">\n        <div class=\"box\" style=\"left:24px; top:0;\">$\\dfrac{3}{4}+\\dfrac{5}{7}$</div>\n        <div class=\"box\" style=\"left:120px; top:0;\">$\\dfrac{1}{2}+\\dfrac{2}{7}$</div>\n        <div class=\"box\" style=\"left:196px; top:0;\">$\\dfrac{7}{10}+\\dfrac{3}{5}$</div>\n\n        <div class=\"placeholder lines-ph\">[Diagram: 红色连线，交叉连接上下方算式与中间两个方框]</div>\n\n        <div class=\"box\" style=\"left:80px; top:98px;\">结果大于1</div>\n        <div class=\"box\" style=\"left:172px; top:98px;\">结果小于1</div>\n\n        <div class=\"box\" style=\"left:20px; top:190px;\">$\\dfrac{2}{3}-\\dfrac{4}{9}$</div>\n        <div class=\"box\" style=\"left:106px; top:190px;\">$\\dfrac{22}{27}-\\dfrac{2}{3}$</div>\n        <div class=\"box\" style=\"left:200px; top:190px;\">$\\dfrac{9}{14}+\\dfrac{3}{7}$</div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- RIGHT COLUMN -->\n    <div class=\"col right\">\n\n      <p>4.一个西瓜，第一次吃了它的$\\dfrac{1}{3}$，第二次吃</p>\n      <p>了它的$\\dfrac{2}{5}$。</p>\n\n      <p>(1)两次一共吃了它的几分之几？</p>\n      <div class=\"work\">$\\dfrac{1}{3}+\\dfrac{2}{5}=\\dfrac{11}{15}$</div>\n\n      <p>(2)这个西瓜还剩下几分之几？</p>\n      <div class=\"work\">$1-\\dfrac{11}{15}=\\dfrac{4}{15}$</div>\n\n      <p>5.春天到了，某学校的同学去郊区植树，四</p>\n      <p>年级同学植了总棵数的$\\dfrac{3}{8}$，五年级同学植</p>\n      <p>了总棵数的$\\dfrac{3}{5}$。</p>\n\n      <p>(1)两个年级一共植了总棵数的几分</p>\n      <p>之几？</p>\n      <div class=\"work\">$\\dfrac{3}{8}+\\dfrac{3}{5}=\\dfrac{39}{40}$</div>\n\n      <p>(2)你还能提出什么数学问题并解答？</p>\n      <p class=\"hw\" style=\"font-size:15px;\">五年级同学比四年级同学多植了总棵数的几分之几？</p>\n      <div class=\"work\">$\\dfrac{3}{5}-\\dfrac{3}{8}=\\dfrac{9}{40}$</div>\n\n      <p>6.佳佳做数学作业用了$\\dfrac{2}{5}$小时，比做语文作</p>\n      <p>业少用$\\dfrac{1}{4}$小时，佳佳做这两科作业一共用</p>\n      <p>了多长时间？</p>\n      <div class=\"work\">$\\dfrac{2}{5}+\\dfrac{1}{4}=\\dfrac{13}{20}$（时）</div>\n      <div class=\"work\">$\\dfrac{2}{5}+\\dfrac{13}{20}=\\dfrac{21}{20}$（时）</div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer-rule\"></div>\n  <div class=\"pagenum\">69</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
